      "value": "YouTube Search has been removed from the 2018.2.3 build, as it relied on WebPanels. This feedback/report is appreciated, but for now, it is no longer relevant.\n\nOnce we re-implement YouTube Search in a future release, please check to see if this is still a problem!",
